# JS Basics

## Setup
- Add `<script src="file.js"></script>` inside the body tag
- `!` + Enter in VS Code gives HTML boilerplate

## Running JS
- Browser console: 3 dots > More Tools > Developer Tools > Console
- In your editor: use `console.log()` to see output in console
- `alert('hello')` pops up a dialog in the browser

